     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>I am trying to make a page that has a navbar with two tabs, one of which contains a tabset. But I can&#39;t get the tables to render when I use both tabs. Below is a minimal example. Am I missing something, perhaps related to these &quot;id&quot; and &quot;value&quot; variables being passed around?</div><div><br></div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">shiny</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br>ui </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> navbarPage</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">  <br>  title</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;Navbar with Tabset&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  position</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;fixed-top&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  header</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">tags$style</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">type</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;text/css&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;body {padding-top: 70px;}&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  tabPanel</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">title</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;Tab1&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    tabsetPanel</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      tabPanel</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;Iris&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dataTableOutput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;iris&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      tabPanel</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;Mtcars&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">dataTableOutput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;mtcars&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      position</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;left&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># comment the 4 lines below and the first tab will work</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  tabPanel</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;Tab2&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    dataTableOutput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;iris&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\">  <br><br><br>server </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">function</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> output</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> session</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    <br>  output$iris </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> renderDataTable</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">iris</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  output$mtcars </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> renderDataTable</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">mtcars</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  <br>  <br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br>shinyApp</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">server </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> server</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> ui </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> ui</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div><div><br></div></div>"
    ]
