    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Answering my own question - turns out the problem had nothing to do with the layout, but the repeated use of &#39;iris&#39; as an outputId. Shiny just breaks when the same outputId is mentioned in multiple UI elements. So if you change the second iris to cars or something, it works.</div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
